{"id":"ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-chain-union-preservation.md","title":"Preservation under Unions of Chains","display":"df-chain-union-preservation — Preservation under Unions of Chains","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-chain-union-preservation","aliases":["17-df-chain-union-preservation"],"display":"df-chain-union-preservation — Preservation under Unions of Chains","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","[[17-df-chain-union]]"],"source_section":"3.2","source_result":"Chain-preservation notion used by Theorem 3.2.3","source_pages_print":[149,150,151],"source_pages_djvu":[165,166,167],"source_verification":"theory-level preservation statement and proof compared in supplied OCR; local sentence predicate","label_origin":"local-catalog","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-chain-union-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-chain-union-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chain-union-preservation — Preservation under Unions of Chains"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cbea1b33aeed1412\" href=\"?note=cbea1b33aeed1412\" title=\"17-df-chain-union\">17-df-chain-union</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Chain-preservation notion used by Theorem 3.2.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span><span>150</span><span>151</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>165</span><span>166</span><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"theory-level preservation statement and proof compared in supplied OCR; local sentence predicate"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 是下式定义域中的句子。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> and sentence truth are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\\)</span> is the coherent structure-union predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cbea1b33aeed1412\" href=\"?note=cbea1b33aeed1412\" title=\"17-df-chain-union\">17-df-chain-union</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L\\)</span> is defined here. Quantified index families are set indexed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\\forall I\\,\\forall{&lt;}\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\sigma)\n\\to\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\\forall I\\,\\forall{&lt;}\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\sigma)\n\\to\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is preservation under whole nonempty substructure chains, with both the carrier and symbol interpretations supplied by the explicit union predicate. The chain need not be elementary. The semantic property is distinct from preservation along an arbitrary pairwise transfer relation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-chain-union","status":"resolved","id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-chain-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ and sentence truth are from [[17-df-sentence]] and [[17-df-sentence-truth]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ and sentence truth are from [[17-df-sentence]] and [[17-df-sentence-truth]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-chain-union","status":"resolved","id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ is the coherent structure-union predicate from [[17-df-chain-union]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\\forall I\\,\\forall{<}\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\\\\\n&\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(I,<,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\sigma)\n\\to\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1981,"backlinks":[{"id":"105ca7a585f377f9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书印刷 p.147（DjVu 163）先定义理论的保持性。本库已有的 [[17-df-preserved]] 与 [[17-df-chain-union-preservation]] 接收单个句子，不能直接接收理论。理论层的链保持性也不能改写成每个原公理分别具有单句保持性：各阶段须同时满足整个理论。这里只补缺少的参数接口，不重复已有句子定义。原书采用序数指标；非空线序表述与原书在一阶理论上的结论一致，前向由有限见证论证，逆向可限制到序数链。"},{"id":"7aab232bf2bcb2df","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L$ (chain-union preservation, see [[17-df-chain-union-preservation]])"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-df-elementary-extension]]\n[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[17-df-embedding]]\n[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-existentially-closed]]\n[[17-df-filter]]\n[[17-df-filters]]\n[[17-df-first-order-language]]\n[[17